After a nearly four-year wait, a new Apple TV is finally expected to be announced as part of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/08/apple-product-launch-october-13/">Apple's "Welcome home" launch</a> on Tuesday, October 13.<br/>
<br/>
